# Cloudflare Pages redirects (deployed with the site).
#
# The Buy buttons on the pricing section point at /buy/<sku>. Each line below
# sends that path to a Stripe Payment Link. Until you paste a link, the button
# goes to the contact form, so no button is ever dead.
#
# To go live: replace /contact on a line with the Payment Link
# (https://buy.stripe.com/...) and merge. See docs/payments.md in the
# firekeeper-server repository for how each link is set up.
/buy/personal       /contact  302
/buy/team-annual    /contact  302
